{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c9e4262794cf61d96088336675acafc95e38262c9d7edd82714f310328a42554", "ja": "念願叶い、春香の地元の海へとやってきた\nやよいたち。思い思いに遊ぶ中、やよいは海\nに磨かれたガラス玉、シーグラスを拾う。\n春香と響の話を聞き、ついに絵の着想を得た\nやよい。後はユニットに全力投球だ！", "zh": "如愿以偿来到春香老家海边的\n弥生等人。在大家各自玩耍时，弥生捡到了\n经海水冲刷打磨的玻璃珠——海玻璃。\n听了春香和响的话，弥生终于找到了画画的灵感。\n接下来就要在组合中全力以赴了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "805000a49d10dfab4fcb69e88702f7d9f9b5600f8cce14c1df33c2f6260a3636", "ja": "（先日の台風は、無事に過ぎ去り……\n今日は澄んだ晴天が目の前にある。そして……）", "zh": "（前几天的台风平安过去了……\n今天，眼前是澄澈的晴空。而且……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "3428425150d2d6081a3c89042a2631d772cdd8935625ebeeee96681fd5f5bddf", "ja": "ここが、春香さんの地元の海……。\n本当に来られました！　みんなで！", "zh": "这里就是春香小姐家乡的大海……。\n真的能来这里了！还是和大家一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "db17b35022f009f57f4a19d87373db05332113a11faf3a0b156c80d86a06c593", "ja": "そうだね、みんなで！　えへへ、嬉しいな～。\nしかもこんなにいいお天気……文句なしだよね♪", "zh": "是啊，大家一起！　嘿嘿，真开心～。\n而且天气还这么好……简直无可挑剔呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "85219642e0b1cff4487909ee62925923d557b8e2ec8376579ca5a35429066312", "ja": "うん！　空も海もまっさらに青くて、最高の\n海日和だね！　ダンス、頑張った甲斐があったさー！", "zh": "嗯！天空和大海都是一片湛蓝，真是最棒的\n海边好天气呀！努力练习舞蹈果然没有白费——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "0c1bfe4fc9736081a74b5e0c35b6148c35988ec3bf45e205c8a26b0277687cd8", "ja": "あっ、そうでした！　春香さんと響さん、\nいつの間にか、ダンスがバッチリになってました！", "zh": "啊，对了！春香姐姐和响姐姐，\n不知不觉间，舞跳得已经特别棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "d91da5ce15277a27f1a4f24e76d43259284d17fbfd7fcf806245e405dd78ca47", "ja": "ふたりに教えてもらえたから、私もすぐ覚えられて……\nすっごく助かっちゃいました！", "zh": "因为有她们教我，我也很快就学会了……\n真是帮了我大忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "0f1f8cb2fa3bf44aa370f86ba41f7e06817286464299a1dbc372ead92c3e6589", "ja": "ふふん♪　自分と春香はお姉さんだからね！\nたまにはいいとこ見せておかなくっちゃ！", "zh": "哼哼♪因为我和春香都是姐姐嘛！\n偶尔也得让大家看看我们厉害的一面才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "ddbd6b6d487aed9c4584657a46b73c4a282e60e4b0e593e7c5a815d54c60b69c", "ja": "そうだよ～。これからも、たくさんいいとこ\n見せなくちゃ！　なーんて♪", "zh": "没错～今后也要多多展现自己优秀的一面才行！开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "775989f6dbf3026432bcb200bd114597641a538b8d4f4ae3b3e497356e6952e2", "ja": "春香さん、響さん……。だったら、\n私もお礼を考えなくっちゃ！", "zh": "春香小姐，响小姐……。这样的话，\n我也得想想怎么道谢才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "faf77c20b4df53a3aebb3b1bee40e186dba869ff738b35c6067c62582649033a", "ja": "そんなこと、気にしなくていいんだよ。\nね、響ちゃん？", "zh": "这种事不用放在心上啦。\n对吧，响？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "2858f871498403f0ebd64060c94cc9bcd93a31dacddf2db3050d8e278f5c13ed", "ja": "うん！　みんなで海に来られたのが、何よりの\nごほうびだからね。自分は、それだけで充分さー！", "zh": "嗯！能和大家一起来海边，就是最棒的奖励了。对我来说，这样就已经足够啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3e46ab6a70be3edbcdff0fac9fd3e2c3edaa44f17a154c577dda7831ee5c6a38", "ja": "そういう事だ。それじゃあ色々見て回りたい\nところだけど、まずは……。", "zh": "就是这么回事。那么，虽然想四处看看，不过首先……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "ebc8c21b850e0e6841a122b4f259f8106c41c367059ad10c3d48c8c563324332", "ja": "そんなの……海に来たら、波打ち際ではしゃぐって\n決まってるさー！　へへっ、一番のりー！", "zh": "那还用说……来到海边，当然要在海浪边玩个痛快啦——！嘿嘿，我是第一个——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "f1e81e5d706f7e52c42507840d17924b6b22d989dc210833c43b776fc29fbd43", "ja": "あっ！　響ちゃん、そんなに走ったら危ないよ！\nやよいも、行こう？　少しくらい濡れても平気だよね♪", "zh": "啊！响，这样跑很危险哦！\n弥生，我们也去吧？稍微弄湿一点也没关系吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "c8fbffdc5bea3b6a1a8880c2ac2a34b75cb8d858807d837e86c152c6fea63a29", "ja": "は、はい！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d2b40075785bb8141c9c968f5a36b3bb7c1be762fb61eab9b16619c7b6661ce4", "ja": "（待望の海だ。\nしばらくは、みんなの好きにさせるか……）", "zh": "（盼望已久的大海。\n暂时就让大家随心所欲地玩吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "4c358d728c5dd4e040343a3ce29095b3d81c18ec77674e2d7e8d9c98d64a70b4", "ja": "ふう！　海で遊んだの、久しぶりだなー！\n泳げないのは、ちょっと残念だけどね。", "zh": "呼——！好久没在海边玩了，真开心啊！\n不过不会游泳，还是有点遗憾呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "b703ccd5af883df549637faa9993e7673a510bf9b15513a88aec71883ba7aff5", "ja": "うん！　私も、地元の海で\nこんなに遊んだのって、久しぶりかも……。", "zh": "嗯！我也是，好久没在家乡的海边玩得这么开心了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "d745101cf14ea59a2a384b09ea42a7d0138afd13c47ae848a2dc6ffde97270cd", "ja": "私は、宝探しをしてました！　砂浜って、\n珍しいものがいっぱい拾えちゃいますね！", "zh": "我在寻宝！沙滩上能捡到好多稀奇的东西呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "9d6f875ff3150d859bb4e17861a3da74de78de52176c4885f60f385a06cd73af", "ja": "春香さん、響さん！　お礼ってわけじゃ\nないんですけど……これ、もらってください！", "zh": "春香、响！虽然不算是道谢啦……\n这个，请收下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "d0d7232f6e1cd369e24220482def927586c63f96a71288ccaef66f2d23f7f7dd", "ja": "わぁ～、ありがとう。……うん。\nキラキラで、きれいな石……♪", "zh": "哇～，谢谢你。……嗯。\n这块闪闪发光的漂亮石头……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "7c9225507e88695b763a652b3ff5e94d179813c8eb2f7bbb4a04aa4efa51c0ab", "ja": "自分ももらうぞ、ありがとう！\nあっ、これってシーグラスだね。", "zh": "我也收下啦，谢谢！啊，这个是海玻璃吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "dcfa5ce80f20513cdf430bae98d4f95bdaa8d5f78fa22b4c07d10e93421e9c42", "ja": "シーグラス……？", "zh": "海玻璃……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "46f30db94d958f763671bf336ec36a6ab5f78f7abeef885a06663f7bd78f8026", "ja": "シーグラスは、ガラスの欠片とかが砂や波で\n丸くなってできるんだ。子どもの頃、よく拾ったなー。", "zh": "海玻璃是玻璃碎片之类的东西，经过沙子和海浪的打磨变圆后形成的。小时候我经常捡呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1024_005yay", "source_sha256": "3d83202f8e0c8d92deca5c659bd0062a03ece08ed038e7950782f962028f1321", "ja": "じゃあこれ、ガラスなんですか？\n海の中で、こんなにキレイになるんですね！", "zh": "那这个就是玻璃吗？\n在海里竟然能变得这么漂亮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "7bb967815e2d7462f8b254d01b8d347d2bcc8fe07b347432592901b39a301705", "ja": "私も、よく拾って集めてたよ。\nお気に入りを探すの、結構楽しいんだ♪", "zh": "我以前也经常捡来收集。寻找自己喜欢的，还是挺开心的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "a992aed4d9a228bba5ab5b2157292ba8164eb44e738583dfa45d58e4de84988f", "ja": "海の近くに住んでると、毎日宝探しができるんですね！\nなんだかステキです！", "zh": "住在海边的话，每天都能寻宝呢！\n感觉真棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "bb2dfcd6b81f787b43825ce1155b44ed359711a16ebfc92a999408229cccb858", "ja": "なるほど。……やよいの海への興味は、\n海そのものじゃなかったのかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此……也许弥生感兴趣的，并不是大海本身。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1028_005yay", "source_sha256": "7b4e3091b0b08277f38f83b34bdd16986cee348b5a75f4eb7d7c68689b007ea1", "ja": "えっ……\n{$P$}、どういうことですか？", "zh": "咦……\n{$P$}，这是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "b603ab0441c0d564f52459579e65aad5f653cb719eda070476af27f8d92245b2", "ja": "ほら、海のイメージについて悩んでいただろう？\n上手くまとめられないって。", "zh": "你不是一直在为大海的意象发愁吗？\n说是没法好好整理出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1030_005yay", "source_sha256": "a534a4b53fc7f60c4afd3ea84cff01e54745a58c1cc3c24af70cb3bcd5428d63", "ja": "はい！　ずっと考えてたけど、\n今もまだ、まとまってなくて……。", "zh": "是的！我一直在思考，可是现在还是没整理好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "3ab67bfa5d79c003571d68d54d29a1d9299de2bb02b4ebf8dbd5d13be5270c08", "ja": "でも、海の近くに住んでいる人の話を聞くのは、\n好きみたいだったよな。だから……。", "zh": "不过，你好像很喜欢听住在海边的人讲述他们的生活来着。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "f44671594e5cdb7b8b309a61aa87ddc5e1a7be7c7517e366ab49cb2ac2c0afdf", "ja": "やよいは海そのものより、海の近くで\n営まれる生活に、興味があるんじゃないかって。", "zh": "我想弥生比起大海本身，其实更对\n海边人们的生活感兴趣吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "3accf438ed7750cbdcaf4730fc34cb8555ffd1efd28725a451ad1b120fac2dd2", "ja": "海の近くの、生活……。", "zh": "海边的生活……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "16da97bd1af6a4e8395153566a6a4152eeff51ddd0ad2f471b1aa17af78b8abb", "ja": "そういえば……紬ちゃんの話も、楽しく聞いてたよね。\n海の近くの生活……うん、やよいらしいと思う！", "zh": "说起来……你也听小紬讲了不少有趣的事吧。\n住在海边的生活……嗯，我觉得很像弥生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "cc677c5c0d1d898cb5b4e1b5e81d059874a933b73659afb841ea2e712861b629", "ja": "どうだ、やよい。\n何か描けそうか？", "zh": "怎么样，弥生。能画出点什么来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1036_005yay", "source_sha256": "38813d6122486a6ea2cc1f614734b427c855f9aceb8a2a2faec2a91496a6e100", "ja": "{$P$}……はい！\nえっと、うまく言えないんですけど。", "zh": "{$P$}……是！\n那个，我也说不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1037_005yay", "source_sha256": "34768b5b92a6fb1a706101235fe7a996d36d1fa91d74f3ee27d09d1b657bdbd5", "ja": "でも、海の近くに住んでいる人とか、\nお魚のことなら……私、描けるかもって。", "zh": "不过，像是住在海边的人，还有鱼什么的……我，说不定能画出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1038_005yay", "source_sha256": "9cb85b58f6cc30166f705f476eacbdb3282451897cf090ff84d2e3d0a793ecd6", "ja": "春香さん、響さん！　{$P$}！\n手伝ってくれて、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "春香姐、响姐！还有{$P$}！\n谢谢你们帮了我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1039_p", "source_sha256": "29a9cd3fc338b314fea246d48434e271e5c0158ad4d967da2d556299d6149bd4", "ja": "いや。やよいが真剣に宿題に向き合ったから、\n見つけられたんだよ。", "zh": "不，是因为弥生认真对待了作业，\n才找到了灵感啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1040_001har", "source_sha256": "6c2c09bae0e4925404976d94e68461b49124f39820a538c7a436d2e271ee5bd0", "ja": "そうそう！\n夏休みの宿題、お疲れさまでした♪", "zh": "对对！\n暑假作业辛苦啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1041_013hib", "source_sha256": "f95df5238ea23d7f48961fdd4e222d7bbea2df07297c0a005903e97cd6967748", "ja": "それじゃあ後は……\nみんなでユニットの活動に、全力投球さー！", "zh": "那么接下来……\n大家一起全力投入组合活动吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1042_p", "source_sha256": "d097fa702dd72d268fe1fd8df683f90e0e14aea2290846f6955cd0ca254b1059", "ja": "（やよいの温かさが軸となり、夏と海のユニットは\nきれいにまとまってくれそうだ……）", "zh": "（以弥生的温暖为核心，这个夏日与大海的组合似乎能很好地凝聚起来了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0148_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0148_story_06_1043_p", "source_sha256": "95e0333f28cfce2215ca33f3bb54af8bde9907d5b40555d25e1716dfe61ad1e2", "ja": "（心地良い海のようなステージで、ファンの\nみんなを大いに癒やしてくれるに違いない！）", "zh": "（在如舒适海洋般的舞台上，她们一定能让所有粉丝都得到极大的治愈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
